config ENCODER_ROBOMASTER
	bool "DJI RoboMaster rotor encoder"
	default y
	depends on MOTOR_DJI_ROBOMASTER
	depends on DT_HAS_DJI_ROBOMASTER_ENCODER_ENABLED
	help
	  Expose the rotor angle a RoboMaster ESC reports as an encoder class
	  device, so that a control loop can close around the motor's own
	  rotor instead of an encoder fitted to the shaft. The device follows
	  every feedback frame of the motor it names, through the RoboMaster
	  driver's rotor callback.
